From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 11:59:37 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] browseui: category cache task states, autocomplete source
 over folders, progress dialog timer (3232)

CompCatCacheDaemon as a runnable task with run, suspend, resume, kill and
the IsRunning states; the shell autocomplete source produces the entries
of the expanded folder (IACList::Expand, IACList2 options, IEnumString
Next/Skip/Reset/Clone); IProgressDialog::Timer reset, pause, resume.

